  {
   "key": "next_step",
   "title": "Possible next steps",
   "text": "A first step could be to contact the Canadian Society for Mucopolysaccharide & Related Diseases Inc., a patient group in Canada that the atlas links to GM2 AB variant [E61905c2]. A second step could be to contact the National Tay-Sachs & Allied Diseases Association, a patient group in the United States that the atlas links to GM2 AB variant [Ed912a71]. A third step could be to ask whether the existing NIH-funded Krabbe research grant, 'CGT and ACD Inhibitors for SRT Treatment of Krabbe Disease,' might be extended or copied to cover GM2 AB variant, since GM2 AB variant does not yet have its own listed grant [Ef352296].",
